        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 17,
        "headingId": 370,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>Gynandroblastoma is a sex cord&ndash;stromal tumour with elements of both female and male differentiation.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-05-13T17:41:29"
      }
    ],
